@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System

[*] --> CreateUserAccount
state Choice1 <<choice>>
state Choice2 <<choice>>
CreateUserAccount : entry / Start state
CreateUserAccount : do / Fill in required details
CreateUserAccount : exit / Login

CreateUserAccount --> Login : user creates account

Login : entry / User registration
Login : do / Authenticate user
Login : exit / Application

Application : entry / User login
Application : do / Apply for visa, make payment and accept application
Application : exit / Status update

Application --> ViewStatus : user views status
ViewStatus : entry / Application submitted
ViewStatus : do / Display current status
ViewStatus : exit / Check status

ViewStatus --> CheckStatus : user checks status
CheckStatus : entry / User viewed status
CheckStatus : do / Update status based on document check
CheckStatus : exit / Cancel application or modify details

CheckStatus --> CancelApplication : visa rejected
CancelApplication : entry / Application submitted
CancelApplication : do / Cancel application
CancelApplication : exit / Logout

CancelApplication --> ModifyDetails : user modifies details
ModifyDetails : entry / User login
ModifyDetails : do / Update user details
ModifyDetails : exit / View details or give feedback

ModifyDetails --> ViewDetails : user views details
ViewDetails : entry / User login
ViewDetails : do / Display user details
ViewDetails : exit / Give feedback

ViewDetails --> GiveFeedback : user gives feedback
GiveFeedback : entry / User viewed status
GiveFeedback : do / Provide feedback
GiveFeedback : exit / Logout

GiveFeedback --> Logout : user logs out
Logout --> [*]

@enduml
